message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Protein Preprocessing & Isoform Selection Pipeline"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible pipeline for protein-level quality control and longest-isoform
  selection across multi-species GFF/protein FASTA datasets, developed as part
  of dissertation work on the identification and evolutionary analysis of
  de novo genes (DNGs).
